WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.940
Tesla stopped solar roof tile shipments in August after installing only 3,000 systems over 7 years. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 624. Looking back over the past week, Tesla posted 486,532 deliveries in the 3rd quarter, and beat expectations by 24,000 vehicles. Model y alone captured 25.7% of all new car registrations in Norway last month. The company also lined up

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:35.500
$30 billion in fresh credit lines aimed at expansion in AI, robotics, and solar.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:40.980
Hasla stopped supplying solar roof tiles in August and told certified installers that

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:46.900
later shipments would be conventional panels instead. The company installed roughly 3,000 solar

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:52.780
roof systems on US homes over seven years, with weekly installs peaking at 21-32.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:59.000
Certification required multi-week training on the west coast plus three supervised projects for

00:00:59.000 --> 00:00:59.900
some contractors.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:05.520
Installations took more than two weeks each, compared with two days for standard rack-mounted

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:05.900
systems.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:10.060
The product never reached the goal of 1,000 weekly installs.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:15.460
New US Model 3 and Model Y performance orders received lifetime premium connectivity

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:16.880
at no extra cost.

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.120
The feature normally costs $99 per year for the first owner.

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:26.400
Severe weather and high winds forced Hesla to move the outdoor roadster event from October

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:32.260
first to October 15 in Texas. The demonstration requires an outdoor setting for the planned

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:37.720
thruster test. Tesla added supercharger sight maps to the legacy model S interface.

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:43.340
Owners describe the screen as visually strong and requested a portrait orientation option.

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:49.640
Volkswagen placed the ID5 electric SUV first on its list of models to discontinue.

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:53.300
The ID-5 competes directly with the Tesla Model Y.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:59.420
All 2027 GM electric vehicles will ship with a Tesla-style NACS port.

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:03.420
The Escalade EV receives an additional home charging upgrade.

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:08.640
Tesla Roddy suggested an option for GROC to shorten spoken responses in the car.

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:13.640
The request noted that many commands could simply be executed with a brief confirmation.

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:18.920
An ex-user highlighted that one car company operates without any drivers at all.

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:24.360
The same account stated that CyberCab will ultimately prevail in the Robotaxi competition.

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:31.960
A man plugged a Tesla charger into a demolished Model 3 after a crash, and the port light blinked to indicate readiness.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:36.640
The infotainment screen showed the charge starting and displayed remaining time.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:43.040
Multiple warning lights appeared, including low tire pressure and a malfunctioning left front turn signal.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:47.680
The front cover was completely detached, the vehicle will be parted out.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:53.580
Google Gemini produced an ultra low-drag, teardrop-shaped vehicle with enclosed wheel wells

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:58.760
and continuous light strips. The concept assumes level 5 autonomy will be standard

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:06.580
by 2050. Tesla's Q3 2026 delivery beat pushed Ather Energy Stock higher, along with other

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:13.960
electric vehicle names. Ather Energy generates 42,441,000,000 rupees in revenue from electric

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:20.640
two wheelers. Ola Electric Mobility generates about 18.7 billion rupees from automotive activities.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:25.780
Starlink introduced a beta program allowing property owners to install one kit

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:31.820
and share access for passive income. The program targets apartment complexes, campgrounds,

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:37.180
and rural locations with nearby demand. Ashton Martin pushed its first electric vehicle

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:41.140
launched to 2033, citing rapidly changing legislation.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:47.440
A former Bentley owner described FSD supervised as life-changing and convinced his brother to

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:48.880
purchase one during a phone call.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:54.880
He stated he would buy 10 vehicles with FSD for employees and called the system 8 times

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.360
safer than the average driver.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:04:07.440
Owners compared the Mercedes-Benz EQE 500, EQS 450, EQS 580, Cadillac Lyric, and BMW IX as

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:13.860
potential used daily commuters. Elon Musk emphasized that Tesla applies extreme caution in self-driving

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:20.120
development. The decision to reduce memory capacity on the AI5 and AI6 chips while

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:23.560
preserving bandwidth reveals a deeper engineering priority.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:30.300
Physical AI systems must react in milliseconds to changing environments, so data movement speed

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:32.380
matters more than storing larger models.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:38.620
On-chip SRAM already delivers far higher exchange rates than external DRAM, even though its

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.000
capacity remains small.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:45.180
This approach trades peak model size for lower latency and reduced power draw.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:53.200
cutting capacity to 72 gigabytes on AI5 and 144 gigabytes on AI6 lowers cost

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:58.480
and improves yield at a time when memory remains scarce. Before we go the next

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.800
road to reveal sits two weeks out and the weather window in Texas will decide

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:07.280
whether the thruster test happens on schedule. And that's a wrap on today's

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:16.760
Tesla news. TSLA closed at $370.59, up $16.48 or 4.7%.

